    {
      "name": "Shadow's Displeasure",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When Haibram has fewer than 150 Hit Points, his shadow pulls at his essence to show the Vesicant Egg's displeasure. He looks pained and confused, and he becomes clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 until healed to 150 Hit Points or more. These conditions increase to 2 when below 100 Hit Points. When below 50 Hit Points, he falls unconscious."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vesicated Shadow",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Haibram's shadow has become corrupted via the power of the Vesicant Egg. His shredded shadow grants him some control over acid and shadows. He gains a +4 status bonus to resist acid and shadow effects."
      ]
    },
