        "occult",
        "shadow"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Haibram can create immense blisters on a creature's shadow, which immediately burst, dealing 20d6 acid damage. He targets a creature within 60 feet that is casting a shadow, which must attempt a DC 37 Will save. Haibram can't use Rupture Shadow again for 1d4 rounds."
      ],
